sequenceDiagram
  participant Timer as HTTP server timer SYSTEM
  participant Worker as RemindersWorker
  participant Service as RemindersService
  participant UOW as TransactionRunner EN-02
  participant DB as MongoDB replica set
  participant Notify as NotificationsService EN-03
  participant Outbox as Outbox worker EN-03
  participant React as React inbox / PT toast
  Timer->>Worker: start ngay, tick60s, batch50
  Worker->>DB: dueAt <= now, anti-join terminal occurrence
  loop mỗi candidate, lỗi riêng không dừng batch
    Worker->>Service: process(source, milestone)
    Service->>UOW: run(session)
    UOW->>DB: snapshot / majority / primary
    opt PT booking
      Service->>DB: schedule_guard revision+1
    end
    Service->>DB: member.service_revision+1
    Service->>DB: tái đọc nguồn, settled_at, continuation, link/PT, occurrence
    Note over Service,DB: Clock/điều kiện đọc lại ở mọi callback retry
    alt đến hạn, trong cửa sổ, đủ điều kiện
      Service->>Notify: persistBusinessEvent(session, snapshot, recipients)
      Notify->>DB: counter + notification + deduped recipients + outbox READY
      Service->>DB: occurrence STORED + source snapshot + notification_id
    else đến hạn nhưng stale/ineligible
      Service->>DB: occurrence SKIPPED với reason
    else chưa đến hạn
      Note over Service,DB: Không ghi terminal
    end
    UOW->>DB: commit hoặc rollback tất cả
    UOW-->>Worker: kết quả sau commit
  end
  Outbox->>DB: claim committed job, lease, retry
  Outbox->>React: notification.created sau auth lại
  React->>Notify: GET sync/inbox qua NestJS, recipient hiện hành
  Notify->>DB: query theo recipient
  Notify-->>React: lịch sử + source allowlist
  Note over React,DB: Detail rồi POST read riêng, trang nguồn vẫn kiểm owner
